{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1473793-actual-play-the-house-always-wins-chronicle","id":1473793,"title":"[Actual Play] The House Always Wins Chronicle","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-02-01T21:02:17-08:00","id":1473793,"title":"[Actual Play] The House Always Wins Chronicle","content":"There was interest in my posting journals for my game, so I figured I would give it a shot. My game is told in character journals, which are optional, so I cannot guarantee a journal for every character, or any character.<br /> <br /> My game, \u201cThe House Always Wins\u201d is set in Las Vegas. The PCs are chosen by their parents to reclaim a Terra Incognita that seems to have recently manifested nearby. After finding and exploring it, they began to set up a spa there, bringing in various Theoi creatures to help, one of the Lampades as a hostess, a Naiad for the spring, an Oread for the mountain, a Satyr bartender, etc. Now they are trying to draw the attention of various Pantheons to get the place running and use it as a base for expanding their own legends beyond it.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s my fourth campaign I have run for Scion, the first for 2e and the first single pantheon game. A lot of the players this time are less familiar with world myth so decided to stay with Greek. To their credit, they wanted to do things right and respectfully. I look forward to teaching them more.<br /> <br /> So, my next post should be introducing you to the PCs, the next post will be some character backgrounds and setting background (from handouts). Then I will post the journals and handouts from the first arc.<br /> <br /> The game is set up with area plotlines, which will slowly move and resolve with or without PC intervention (but have milestones measured in arcs, so the PCs will have time to intervene as they wish) and plotlines centered on the spa (which are usually the main arcs). Every named NPC has a portrait. I am not posting all those pictures but can post any people are curious about. That is a balance when I post games online what to do about the often over 100 NPC pictures.<br /> <br /> I want to stress I am posting this for pleasure reading but also for inspiration for other\u2019s games. So hopefully this will be helpful.<br /> <br /> ETA: Also, check out the sister game <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1478257-actual-play-the-ultra-violets-chronicle\">The Ultra Violets.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 08-01-2022, 02:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-01T21:40:05-08:00","id":1473797,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bB45VNW/Avril1-Copy.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Avril Hart<br /> Patron: Artemis<br /> Pantheon: Theoi<br /> Gender: Biromantic Asexual Woman<br /> Concept: Cryptid Hunter<br /> Origin: Arizona, USA<br /> Arena: Physical<br /> Approach: Finesse<br /> Paths: Camping, Cryptid Hunter, Artemis\u2019s Chosen<br /> Role: Powerhouse<br /> Callings: Liminal, Hunter, Warrior<br /> Purviews: Artistry, Beasts, Epic Dexterity, Epic Perception, Forge, Metamorphosis, Wild<br /> Titles: The Bloody Ranger, The Hawk-Eyed Tracker, Sleepless Shroud<br /> <br /> A Cryptid Hunter and Photographer, Avril has spent most of her life on the road and in the wilderness. Her talent for photographic Cryptids, and hunting those who threatened humanity, lead to her being chosen by Artemis as one of her Scions.<br /> <br /> Avril is not a people person, shy and quiet. Put her in the wilderness, though, she is capable and confidant, being an expert tracker and keen-eyed sharpshooter. These talents and her relic rifle make her the most dangerous member of the group in open combat, or wide-open space. Her survival skills make her an important companion away from the city.<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GP5nq8c/Jimmy3-Copy.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Gemi &quot;Jimmy Ramen&quot; Rahman<br /> Parent: Hermes<br /> Pantheon: Theoi<br /> Gender: Straight Man<br /> Concept: Wheelman of the Gods<br /> Origin: Jakarta, Indonesia<br /> Arena: Physical<br /> Approach: Finesse<br /> Paths: Groomed For Greatness, Higher, Further, Faster Baby!, Wise Beyond Your Years<br /> Role: Smart Guy<br /> Callings: Guardian, Hunter, Sage<br /> Purviews: Deception, Frost, Epic Dexterity, Journeys, Metamorphosis, Stars<br /> Titles: Collector of Conundrums, Unshakable Spectre, Patron of Shrouded Truths<br /> <br /> Gemi was groomed for greatness from early on, being trained along with another of other Scions in central Asia. Gemi rebelled, however, fighting his would-be mentors and escaping. Now, he seeks peace with his father, and father is ready to listen.<br /> <br /> Gemi is best known as the team wheelman, with a car monstrously souped up by Daedalus. He is also an expert in Silat. But Gemi also collects secrets, gathering knowledge however he can, and trading that knowledge for more secrets. He also seeks to protect his companions, and anyone under the spa\u2019s protection.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/B4VHXvP/Imke-Copy.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Imke Madeline Scheit. \u201cThe Lioness\u201d<br /> Parent: Hecate<br /> Pantheon: Theoi<br /> Gender: Lesbian woman<br /> Concept: Femme Fatale<br /> Origin: Antwerp, Flanders, Belgium<br /> Arena: Social<br /> Approach: Finesse<br /> Paths: International Agent, Infiltrator, La Belle Dame Sans Merci<br /> Role: Lancer<br /> Callings: Liminal, Lover, Trickster<br /> Purviews: Beauty, Darkness, Death, Deception, Epic Perception, Metamorphosis, Moon, Sky<br /> Title: The Lioness in Shadow, The Ferryman\u2019s Mistress, Silken Stranger<br /> <br /> Imke was born in Belgium in the middle of World War II. Shaped by those experiences, she became a secret agent working for NATO during the cold war and later Yugoslav conflict. Retiring at the turn of the century, she recently woke up finding herself 50 years younger, and her mother in need of her again.<br /> <br /> Imke is a dangerous spy, her tools of the trade stealth, murder, seduction, blackmail, and shapeshifting. Her multi-decade disconnect from popular culture works against her, but even so the Lioness is everywhere and anywhere, and knows how to destroy you, physically or emotionally. She is, however, trying to find her heart, a dangerous thing for a spy.<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0yFZ689/Johnny-Copy.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Johnny Miravino<br /> Parent: Dionysus<br /> Pantheon: Theoi<br /> Gender: Pansexual Man<br /> Concept: Son of Dionysus<br /> Origin: Templeton, California, USA<br /> Arena: Social<br /> Approach: Finesse<br /> Paths: Brought Up in the Family Business, Social Mover and Shaker, Life of the Party<br /> Role: Heart<br /> Callings: Creator, Lover, Trickster<br /> Purviews: Chaos, Deception, Epic Charisma, Fertility, Metamorphosis, Passion<br /> Title: The Cunning Linguist,(Work in Progress)<br /> <br /> A son of Dionysus, Johnny spent much of his life moving throughout the jet set, travelling from one job to another. During this life he started expanding his marijuana business and was just settling into that when his father came calling.<br /> <br /> Xanthias is the leader and Imke the beauty, but Johnny is the life of the party, the go to guy, the center of attention. Johnny is never alone, making friends anywhere he goes and usually has his entourage fight for him. And if the party is not exciting enough, he can make things really get crazy. But he is a caring man, which sometimes makes him feel at odds with his father.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 08-02-2022, 08:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-01T21:41:58-08:00","id":1473799,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tzsSW0p/Xanthias1-Copy.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Xanthias Plutonides<br /> Parent: Hades<br /> Pantheon: Theoi<br /> Gender: Straight Man<br /> Concept: Eccentric Doctor<br /> Origin: Eleusis, Greece<br /> Arena: Mental<br /> Approach: Power<br /> Paths: A Man of Wealth of Taste, Controversial Surgeon, Prince of Hades<br /> Role: Leader<br /> Callings: Healer, Judge, Leader<br /> Purviews: Death, Beast (Snakes) Earth, Health, Metamorphosis, Order<br /> Title: The Monster Whisperer, Savior of the Broken, the Beaten and the Damned, Master of Life and Death<br /> <br /> Xanthias was raised in the best schools by Hades and Persephone\u2019s cult, given a valuable education, and chose to become a surgeon. Fate would intervene, however, and he found himself instead leading a rag tag group of Scions.<br /> <br /> Xanthias is a man of powerful charisma, an intimidating figure who feels a kinship to monsters, having been raised around a Gorgon who now serves as his Girl Friday and his pet Kerbous Hound. He retains his talents for healing, his talents for leading, and his talents for command. He is a bit out of touch with his emotions, however, much to the consternation of those who care about him.<br /> <br /> Alisa, Gorgon Follower (Xanthias)<br /> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9ps2MVQ/Alesia.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Daedalus, Human Guide (Jimmy)<br /> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/P9ckqD9/Daedalus.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Evelyn Eventide, Hesperid Guide (Imke)<br /> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GHWnWB0/Evelyn-Eventide.webp\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Backgrounds from Imke and Avril soon, along with some of my handouts on the territory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 08-02-2022, 08:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-01T23:01:23-08:00","id":1473808,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>Avril Hart</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/42Ryp7r/Avril2.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> <br /> <br /> Avril considered herself an ethical hunter. She only killed what she needed, and only of species that were a danger to their surrounding environment: overpopulated, invasive, demonic, etc. So when she first saw the Hind (a soft golden glow, too many antlers) she holstered her shotgun and raised her camera. The Hind almost seemed to wait until her chosen weapon was at the ready before it began to run.<br /> <br /> It leapt nimbly over rocks and between trees, all of its movements too fast to be caught on camera. Avril\u2019s mundane legs shouldn\u2019t have been able to keep up at all, but the Hind slowed when she did. Both creature and girl were enjoying the chase. Avril was only vaguely aware of the passage of time. She grew tired and hungry, but not unmanagably. The sky darkened, but she knew if she stopped she would lose her prey. That was unthinkable. Although the Hind seemed unwilling to outrun her, it was willing to outlast her. If she died of thirst before getting its photo, then she wasn\u2019t worthy.<br /> <br /> A small, quiet part of Avril\u2019s brain was aware that she was being tested. It chafed against the idea. But after all those hours, those bruises, the emptiness in her stomach, she NEEDED that picture. She needed the prize to make the pain worth it.<br /> And then, for a split second, the Hind was distracted. A sound elsewhere in the woods, some other animal calling out for its kin. <i>SNAP. </i>Avril didn\u2019t need to look through at her camera\u2019s display to know she had gotten it.<br /> <br /> Relief flooded her, adrenaline stopped, suddenly her limbs felt like they weighed a hundred pounds. She leaned against a tree and closed her eyes. She was nearly asleep when she felt a giant nose sniffing her hair. She opened an eye. The Hind was nuzzling her. Avril extended a hand to gently push its nose away. It started chewing a piece of her hair. She laughed shakily. When she found her voice she asked, \u201cDid I win?\u201d<br /> <br /> The Hind answered by lowering itself to the ground, inviting her to sit on its back. She did. The creature\u2019s back was more comfortable than it had any right to be, the hoof beats too rhythmic. Avril wondered if she was dreaming.<br /> <br /> The Hind brought her home. <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DRzTNNQ/Ceryneian-Hind.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> (Avril's Guide)</div> <br /> <div align=\"center\"><b>Imke Scheit</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6BthksM/Imke2.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> <br /> <br /> Imke Scheit was born October 27<sup>th</sup>, 1943, in Antwerp, Belgium during the Nazi occupation. Antwerp was liberated just before her first birthday. While her family was wealthy, being Germans in Belgium, they found themselves ostracized, and young Imke found herself socially isolated away from the German-speaking parts of the country. She mastered Dutch (being in Flanders) and French quickly, and soon English as well. Still, she never quite fit in, a situation exacerbated by her Queerness.<br /> <br /> Still, she had beauty, and she had money. Her family had kept their fortunes due only to their role in the Resistance, though even that could not save them socially. But Imke was sent to the best schools all women\u2019s education and given opportunities few women had. Unfortunately, she was also kicked out of two schools and three Universities for affairs with teachers and students.<br /> <br /> Still her skills in Seduction, breaking and entering, and generally getting her way were noticed by certain individuals who gave her the opportunity to help prevent Belgium from falling to a third dictator. She was trained by NATO and sent into the field working against agents of the Warsaw Pact. Imke worked in East Germany, West Germany, Czechoslovakia, Yugoslavia, Greece, and Austria against the Communists states, though she had an ambiguous role in Yugoslavia after it broke from the Warsaw Pact. She proved very good at disguising herself as being German (her natural background) Dutch, Danish, Slovene, or Austrian. Moving place to place and shifting accent to accent, Imke was a natural.<br /> <br /> She was also a child of the Goddess of Witches, something she knew from a young age. She found herself able to make people forget interactions and blend into her surroundings with ease. She was also known for being able to compromise nearly anyone, man or woman, she came across if she put her mind to it. She used her gender to get close to wives, girlfriends, and mistresses, and manipulated them into acquiring their paramours\u2019 secrets. If this caused her any guilt, she never showed it. Men were not safe from her either, but such was not her preferred approach. And a lot of the men could spot her as a shark because they were more on guard for such. Still, she was immensely successful and, known as the Lioness, became a favored NATO agent.<br /> <br /> After the wall fell, on November 9<sup>th</sup> of 1989, she was repurposed for limiting Russian influence in the former Yugoslavia but found herself in over her head. After the death of Josip Broz Tito, it fell apart, leading to not only warring factions but ethnic cleansing. Imke operated primarily in Belgrade and focused on limiting Russian influence as was her assignment, but also did what she could to slow the wheels of Genocide.<br /> <br /> Just before the 1999 bombing began, she was moved out of Belgrade back to Belgium. While she entered Domestic intelligence work, after the World Trade Center Attack on September 11<sup>th</sup> of 2001 she was called back to NATO intelligence. But she was 54 now. She was tired, and she had little desire to enter into what she saw as a holy war. Especially as she did not perceive herself as being on either side.<br /> <br /> She entered a quiet retirement, painting and gardening at her family\u2019s ancestral Home. By 2007 she was the only one there, save servants, and went out less and less. By the dawning of 2021 she was 77 and getting less active despite being spry for her age. However, that is when there was a twist of fate.<br /> <br /> Hecate needed her now. It was time to pay her back for the gifts she had made such use of in Europe. But this call came with a reward; she woke up and appeared to be in her early 20s, and she felt like it too. After the surprise and screaming cooled down, she was met by an enchanting lady in red, Evelyn Eventide, one of the Hesperides (Imke presumed using an alias), and a new task. Head to Las Vegas in America. Serve Hecate within what should be a Spa that many divinities may come and go through, to see to the interests of the Goddess of Witches and perhaps nudge events and opinions a bit for some of the august personages there. Surely, for one accustomed to getting people wrapped around her finger this was a challenge and a reward?<br /> <br /> Imke did not exactly see going to the USA as a reward, largely perceiving it as a nation of bumpkins. Still, she was young, she was beautiful, and she was ready to take on the world. And apparently Queerness is hip now? Imke packed her bags. It was indeed time for a new challenge.<br /> --<br /> <br /> So this handout had a few different paragraphs per character. I am going to combine them here into one list.<br /> <br /> No Pantheon controls Las Vegas, indeed, emissaries and playboys alike from many different Pantheons, and darker things besides, pass into and out of the city without a care. They are rarely stopped but often noted. The Pantheon with the most influence in Vegas is the Netjer. The Egyptian Pantheon has a number of agents in the city, Scion and otherwise, who seem less interested in influencing the vicissitudes of the mortal city than the architecture and surveying the general area. Precisely what they are up to is not known, but most Pantheons are not too concerned. The Dev\u00e1 seem\u2026curious\u2026but less worried than being sure the Netjer are not getting uppity.<br /> <br /> As far as your information has it, the second most organized Pantheon group are the Te\u014dtl of Mexica. The Te\u014dtl lurk more on the fringes. While some are haunting the strip, their base and goals are similarly obfuscated to the Netjer, but they are even harder to track down. Common thought it they may be preying on some visitors who may not be missed, but this is pure conjecture.<br /> <br /> The Mojave is an unforgiving desert but maintains quite a bit of wildlife. Much of them are lizards, snakes, and turtles. There are also a half dozen dangerous venomous snakes. More significantly, there are a significant number of powerful beasts called Nemeans. Nemeans are powerful and cannot be hurt by slashing or piercing weapons. Killing Nemeans is a way to achieve status among Scion hunters. Most Nemeans are Reptiles in the Mojave, but Nemean Boars happen. The Desert also has burrowing wormlike creatures of various sizes, which are more unique to the Mojave Desert. Precisely how big they get are not known but\u2026there are stories\u2026<br /> <br /> Avril has heard rumors that a Cockatrice is somewhere in the Mojave. Such a creature probably gives the strip a wide berth but is dangerous to desert travelers. Hunting such a creature is likely to be dangerous; you will want to prepare carefully before setting out.<br /> <br /> As far as knowing what is out there, the Netjer have a Scion of Set named Maggie Dalton who keeps an eye on supernatural threats coming from the Mojave and knowing who is active on the hunt. You could do worse than getting on her good side. On the other hand, you might want to avoid an Authority figure at all costs, up to you.<br /> <br /> Your sources suggest the best place to get in touch with the Te\u014dtl a Western bar called Tex Cat\u2019s on the outer fringes of town, away from the strip. Look for a black cat in a Stetson on a neon sign. There are no guarantees a visit to Tex Cat\u2019s will be safe.<br /> <br /> An agent of the Netjer is Merneith, Abigail Khan among mortals. Her precise role is not clear, but she has a finger on quite a bit of the Underworld activity. The assumption is to keep criminals from interfering too much in the Netjer\u2019s business. Whether she is a Scion or not and of whom is not well known. What is known is people go out of their way not to anger her, and in general she does not make this very difficult. Despite clearly not being at the top of the Netjer hierarchy, she certainly behaves like she owns the place. How she relates to the Te\u014dtl you don\u2019t know.<br /> <br /> Word is Native American Pantheons and their Scions give Vegas a wide berth. While rumor has it that this is due to some curse, as far as you can tell no one ever actually said that. What is known is while some Titanspawn related to various Native Pantheon do enter from time to time, the various native Pantheons are not. Well, except the Te\u014dtl. They have no hesitation at all.<br /> <br /> As someone connected to the party side of Vegas, the Netjer to contact would be Rashawn Thompson. A Scion of Sobek, he makes a point of being a concoct point for visitors. He looks intimidating you are told but apparently a friendly and laid back dude, at least when things are going well, he is also a fairly large man with an entourage of Ushabti warriors, just in case. Not a problem for you, right?<br /> <br /> On the darker side, Margarita Rios-Garcia, a Scion of Tlaz\u014dlt\u00e9\u014dtl, is rumored to have some fucking awesome underground parties. Exclusive. Invitation only. Not everyone gets out. Apparently if you like your parties with wild drugs and partygoers this is who to find. Wait, Wikipedia says Tlaz\u014dlt\u00e9\u014dtl is a poop goddess? That can\u2019t be right can it?<br /> <br /> What could be more exciting than a posse full of monster hunting Elvis impersonators? You are not sure who he is a Scion of, or even what Pantheon, but Bruce Haas and his team hunt monsters and provide security for parties. While evidence suggests he is not working for or with the Netjer, you are not sure.<br /> <br /> Vegas has a significant Dead population. While there are not more native ghosts than one would expect, visitors who die there often remain. Precisely why is not known, but they don\u2019t seem to be working for anyone, nor do they seem trapped per se. The party just never ends, but continues forever, at least until they sink into the Underworld, but some have remained decades. They don\u2019t get up to much, as a rule, but sometimes they do see things.<br /> <br /> According to your scouts there is an apparently empty hospital left a bit outside the strip when one was built closer. It\u2019s popular with Urban Explorers and may or may not be haunted. No rumors of monsters but\u2026maybe investigate to be sure before building a cult in there. Still, for a man of wealth and connections it can be done.<br /> <br /> Those looking to expand local influence without kissing up to Netjer or wallow with the Te\u014dtl may find agents about related to the Shen. Not the Bureaucracy itself, rather a curious figure called Pipa Jing. Known for consuming sinners, she fought Chinese heroes even as she occasionally worked for the more vengeful gods. Those who know the Jade Pipa know where she is, the fox Demon Da Ji, scourge of heaven, cannot be far behind.<br /> <br /> --<br /> While you have not spent a lot of time in Vegas, you have heard a few things about the local color and mystic places. This handout is just a few places you have heard about.<br /> <br /> Your Spa has a built-in gate that can be used by various gods to access your Spa. Initially only Olympians, but that can be changed based on need if someone has the key and allows it. It is not, however, the only such place in Vegas<br /> <br /> Touchstones can be used to travel between places in The World with a similar resonance. Pyramids, henges and such. This can save you a lot of air travel. You do have to be aware of such a place to travel to it, but if you are there are no ends of options. There may be Gates or Strange Places, as well as Touchstones, you are unaware of. <div align=\"center\"><b>The Luxor</b> (Sphinx and Pyramid)</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The Luxor has a number of Touchstones that can get one to several places in Egypt. From the Sphynx to the Valley of the Kings, or Valley of the Queens, or actual Luxor, travel to and from Las Vegas to Egypt is easy. On a practical level, this means the Netjer can easily get to and from their homeland to Vegas, and essentially own the Luxor.<br /> <br /> The Luxor is not only useful to the Netjer. The Pyramid can be used to Travel to Mexico, Guatemala, Honduras or Peru, among other places. This means the Aztec Te\u014dtl and Incan Apu can move their Scions and creatures to and from there as well. While the Apu are not known to have a presence in Vegas, the Te\u014dtl are, and while they don\u2019t control the Luxor, they do find travel to and from via it useful.<br /> <br /> Rumor has it the Luxor has a gate to Duat. While most actual pyramids have a gateway to the Underworld, the Luxor is a recreation, so it is not for sure to have the connection. Of course, you can feel free to ask the Netjer about it. <div align=\"center\"><b>Caesar\u2019s Palace</b> (Coliseum)</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> While more minor than the Luxor, Caesar\u2019s Palace has a connection to Rome. One can travel swiftly from Coliseum to Coliseum this way. Not as many similar locations but still, it is a quick way to Europe. Caesar\u2019s Palace is under Netjer control, but they absolutely do not put any limits on Theoi Scions or immortals traveling via it. They keep an eye on things, certainly, but they would not dare cause an interpantheon incident by blocking it, especially for often allies no matter how much they dread the idea of too many Theoi Scions in a place they have any sort of responsibility for.<br /> <br /> The Theoi have a reputation is what I am saying. <div align=\"center\"><b>New York-New York</b> (Statue of Freedom)</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The Statue of Liberty present at the New York-New York hotel offers and easy way to get to the East Coast of the United States. As in all cases, the Netjer observe. A surprising number of other locations also have Statues of Liberty, actually, including one in County Donegal, one in Pristina Kosovo, a few scattered all over the United States, and even one in Vietnam. Paris also has a Statue of Liberty in the Seine, but this Touchstone is not the usual route taken to get there. Rather, a hotel with a tower and more Parisian theme tends to be the one to do that. <div align=\"center\"><b>The Paris Hotel</b> (Tower)</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The Paris hotel allows travel to (wait for it) Paris, via the tower. Interestingly, similar towers can go to other places if you happen to know the local, including most notably Japan. Your Pantheon has all but wiped out the Nemetondevos, so none are going to object to taking it to Paris. Some may argue it is in bad taste for a Theoi to do this but on the other hand, the Eiffel Tower long postdated the Nemetondevos, so perhaps not. The Kami don\u2019t mind using it to go to Japan so long as some appropriations are made. For their part, this gets watched less by the Netjer, though they are aware of it, and the Kami don\u2019t seem to use it much to get to the city.<br /> <br /> There are several other major hotel casinos which may well have a Touchstone or Gate within, such as the Excalibur or the Sahara. However, there is one or two more locations worth mentioning. <div align=\"center\"><b>Aspasia\u2019s Labyrinth</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Aspasia\u2019s Labyrinth is not a Touchstone, but a large labyrinthian club in South Vegas. The labyrinth is run by a human woman calling herself <b>Aspasia</b>, who is definitely not the historical one. \u201cAspasia\u201d is a popular Deifan who is said to know many Scions, and likely has designs on Scionhood, or possibly being the mother of a Scion, herself. She has had some luck getting Scions, immortals, and even monsters to show up. Her club is often exciting but not necessarily safe. Dance floors and balconies, even small bars, and connected by winding hallways, and one can in fact get very lost here. Rumor has it a few disappearances have happened too, but the law tends to be kept away.<br /> <br /> The greater opinion among the Pantheons seems to be \u2018meh.\u2019 Aspasia is far from the only Deifan with a major following. Being seen with her can build your profile, albeit in a way connecting you to, well, fandom. The Theoi as a whole have no issue with it but wish she chose a different name, by and large. The original Aspasia is unavailable for comment. <div align=\"center\"><br /> <b>The Mojave Desert</b></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The Mojave is a place of intense magical energy. Even the spa\u2019s place may in part be due to this suffusion. The Desert has no lack of monsters, some of which can be enormous. But also potentially places useful for finding material for building Relics There are a number of reasons to brave the Mojave for those inclined, including hunting big game. You might just want to walk without rhythm.<br /> <br /> The Mojave can be used to connect to a greater Axis Mundi desert that connects to other deserts. This is extremely dangerous to do unless you are very well prepared for desert survival, but it is possible.<br /> <br /> Also, Area 51 and a Clown themed motel with a Cemetery behind it. It has dolls also. That is all out there too. Then there is the haunted brothel that is still running with a crashed plane beside it. And all those empty ghost towns that dot the landscape of the Mojave and may or may not be really empty. Everything in this paragraph is, by the way, very very real.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 04-22-2022, 05:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-07T17:49:33-08:00","id":1474148,"title":"","content":"The First arc was a four-session story wherein the PCs arrived in Las Vegas and got set up at their Spa, eventually named \u201cThe Lucky Lindworm.\u201d The PCs meet, overcome a few foes, get allies to set up their Spa, and take a look around Vegas before showing the facility to their parents.<br /> <br /> We only have journals from Imke and Xanthias, with Xanthias covering the second two sessions and Imke all four. I also have a short vignette near the end there. <div align=\"center\"><br /> <u>Session I</u></div> <br /> NOTEBOOK: #769 Lima Echo Echo Uniform Whisky India November<br /> <br /> ENTRY: ALFA ONE<br /> <br /> Las Vegas, USA<br /> <br /> Arrived in Las Vegas 0230Z, established myself at RESIDENCE. Familiarized myself with territory.<br /> <br /> Met TEAM for dinner 48 hours later 0230Z at \u201cThe Bellagio\u201d. Other than surprise Gorgon no issues. Never expected to type the preceding sentence. Departed for SITE at 0400Z. Encountered three hostiles \u201cMen In Black\u201d who were removed by force without difficulty. Some hostile fauna, but infiltrated cave without issue. Arrived at target SITE by 0430Z. Definitely not in Kansas anymore. (1)<br /> <br /> Impressions of TEAM for ASSIGNMENT<br /> <br /> Hart, Avril: Daughter of Artemis. Reserved, bold, poor table manners. Butch. Photographer and Hunter. Skilled Outdoorswoman. I want her to fucking destroy me physically and emotionally at least one good time. No concerns.<br /> <br /> Miravino, Johnny: (Not real name?) Son of Dionysus. Seems intent to avoid being alone. Draws crowds. Commands Pestilence. Is friendly, ingratiating. He is a man difficult to dislike. No concerns.<br /> <br /> Plutonides, Xanthias: Son of Hades. Maintains a service Kereboi and Gorgon handler. Unused to being around human? Debonair., friendly, but does not allow much to slip out. Unsure if he has handler due to being untrustworthy or unreliable. Bears watching. No other red flags. Dog is adorable.<br /> <br /> Rahman, Gemi: ALIAS &quot;Jimmy Ramen.\u201d Scion of Hermes. From Jakarta. It\u2019s no Kuala Lumpur but there are worse places to kill a man. Seems friendly, eager to please. Wheelman. Guide. Helpful. Stay on good side of. At the very least, he puts up with \u201cWhite People White Peopling\u201d well. No Concerns.<br /> <br /> Scheit, Imke: Scion of Hecate. Such a fucking fossil she writes up reports as if she still has superiors to read them. Doubtlessly, this is a sign of madness. Many concerns.<br /> <br /> (1)Actually not that far from Kansas right now. Surreal.<br /> <br /> EINDE<br /> __<br /> <br /> Imke will loosen up as more journals come out. The room set up for the PCs only had enough seats for them, but Johnny came with an entourage of human followers, and Xanthias brought his Gorgon Girl Friday Alisia and his Kerberos Hound to the dining room. An extra chair was fetched so Alisia could sit, at least.<br /> <br /> They met their Guides, then moved on to the site, a tor near Hendersonville. There they encountered MIBs and some giant Scorpions, just to give them a few minor foes to fight. They did better against the Scorpions than MIBs, probably the improved grasp of the combat system.<br /> <br /> The MIBs are tied to an in Vegas plotline, but it has not really kicked off yet. The Scorpions were just fun monsters to fight.<br /> <br /> -- <div align=\"center\"><u>Session II</u></div> <br /> NOTEBOOK: #769 Lima Echo Echo Uniform Whisky India November<br /> <br /> ENTRY: ALFA TWO<br /> <br /> Las Vegas, USA<br /> <br /> Finished clearing SITE at 0435Z. Xanthias convinced a Lindworm who had taken up residence to allow us in. A number of assistants were brought in by Daedalus, Evelyn, and Lykos. This group included:<br /> <br /> TWO Oreads (to help shape the stone)<br /> A Baker\u2019s Dozen of Maenads (to help with security)<br /> ONE Lar (to act as local household spirit)<br /> TWO Lemures (to act as labor)<br /> ONE Unseelie Fae Noblewoman (to do magical paintings)<br /> <br /> The group set about to get things set up for ASSIGNMENT. The Fae, whose name is Aoibhe, went to take the air and I followed. Aoibhe was a charming conversationalist, and we soon found ourselves in a room, sharing a passionate embrace. Later that night when we retired, she did so in my chamber. (1)<br /> <br /> The next afternoon at 2200Z discussed ASSIGNMENT<br /> <br /> Xanthias will oversee work at SITE<br /> Avril and I will approach the Netjer to assure cooperation.<br /> Jimmy and Johnny will approach the Te\u014dtl<br /> I will approach LOCAL AGENCY<br /> Several of us will investigate \u201cAspasia\u2019s Labyrinth\u201d to get examinations if the ground.<br /> <br /> Am enjoying ASSIGNMENT already (2).<br /> <br /> (1) I have not been with anyone in over twenty years. Aoibhe was a delightful lover, despite being inexperienced with women (though not in general). I did, I think, rather impress her. We agreed it would be best for her to use that room or the one at RESIDENCE. Hopefully tomorrow night we will use the large bedroom there.<br /> <br /> (2) Mother chose a woman who is a master of infiltration, seduction, information warfare, assassination, and breaking wills via non torture related means to help run a Spa. I am fairly sure she does not want me to be just making sure the pipes are working (3). It will be a nice change up. I miss Europe though. America is too new, and too loud.<br /> <br /> (3) And if she does, hey, I could use a vacation and spending time with pretty girls who may not get upset when I flirt.<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> Yeah the Lindworm was the boss fight, but Xanthias channeled a Marvel through his Beast (Snake) purview and managed to negotiate/intimidate the reptile into backing down.<br /> <br /> The various mythological folks brought in were based on parents, the Oreads from Artemis, the Maenads from Dionysus, the Lemures from Hades, the Lares from Hermes, and the Dark Fae from Hecate. Traveling into the tour took them through a portal into a Terra Incognita where the site is inside a mountain and they have a view of a primeval forest below, city in the distance. So the Oreads can reshape that, especially Echo who is very potent at this stage.<br /> <br /> The Lemurs are Sullis and Donum, the lead Maenad is Evangeline, the Oreads are Sapphira and Echo, the Lares they got to name and the PCs went with Alexis for a gender-neutral name. and the Aos Sidhe was of course Aoibhe.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-07T18:01:48-08:00","id":1474149,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><u>Session III</u></div> <br /> NOTEBOOK: #769 Lima Echo Echo Uniform Whisky India November<br /> <br /> ENTRY: ALFA THREE<br /> <br /> Las Vegas, USA<br /> <br /> Met with Marneith at 2300Z. She is a somewhat severe woman, but very beautiful. A Mummy apparently, unsure if she was a former pharaoh or not. She wanted to know what TEAM was doing, and I told her as much as she needed to know. In the end, she warmed to me somewhat. They usually do.<br /> <br /> I returned around 0030Z to find the others had recruited a Satyr bartender named Darius and Naiad water expert named Lenore. Xanthias also noted he was trying to recruit Sapphira, which was fine with me. Gal has some nice tattoos. If Lenore and Sapphira bond with the place, they will be part of it, sort of possessing it, knowing what happens in the walls or waters. This could be very valuable. I will probably seduce both of them to make sure I have access to this information. And it seems fun. Sapphira is clearly bisexual, I am not sure about Lenore but I am confidant. She has a pulse even if she does not look like she does.<br /> <br /> Sadly, Echo is not staying. I am not surprised, but slightly disappointed. She is beautiful and confidant, like Aoibhe, and I heard tell of her from long ago. Anyway.<br /> <br /> We decided to go to Aspasia\u2019s Labyrinth, outside of Johnny who wished to meet with a Te\u014dtl Scion named Margarita Rios-Garcia. I traveled home at 0200Z with Aoibhe so she could rest somewhere posher. She talked me into wearing a corset, miniskirt, and knee-high boots to the club though. Those were intended for later when we were alone. I did look good in them, and an internet search showed it was not too far out there for club wear. Silently vowing to myself Aoibhe would learn hard lessons about what happens when I don my leather, I went to the club at 0400Z.<br /> <br /> I was rather uncomfortable at first. I still like my appearance, but I was not wearing much. Granted, I was not the only one. Jimmy was quite the gentleman though. We even danced some. I got more comfortable after a while. Xanthias remained surrounded by women (Alisa, Echo, and Sapphira) and struck quite a figure. Enough for Aspasia, on her dais, to take notice. Still, he went deeper into the place rather than speaking to her when noticed. While it has a large open room in the front, there are several doorways leading to winding halls full of people.<br /> <br /> It certainly reminded me of clubs I have been in before. It\u2019s been so long since I went in without a specific clandestine reason that I found myself at a bit of a loss. We met a Scion named Tanith Ravenscroft, who described herself as a \u201cwatcher\u201d of the place. Xanthias took point in talking to her. I noticed that she was interested romantically in a woman called Hatshepsut, which I am unsure if she is the original or, like Aspasia, using the name. She was interested in a Scion of Sobek named Rashawn Thompson also, the same one Marneith mentioned. She gave us a beware of this and that and did not mention her birth parent or pantheon. Between Tanith and Aspasia, there are serious egos in here.<br /> <br /> We spoke to Johnny, who had run into a Scion of Chernobog (Communist?) named Milos Grozny. Grozny means The Terrible, but he did not translate that part. He met a number of women from Southeast Asia also, who seemed to confuse him with their questions.<br /> <br /> For my part I have had enough of these ego cases for one night. I am home now, and here, as Aoibhe will soon find, I am Queen. Now where did I leave my crop\u2026<br /> <br /> EINDE <div align=\"center\"><b><u> <br /> Driving interlude</u></b></div> <br /> As Xanthias drove through the garish neon kaleidoscope that was the early AM streets of Vegas he didn\u2019t find it all that different. Brighter and louder than LA perhaps but the same feeling of restless insomniac energy. The chill was different. California was humid. Vegas was dry and at night it got decidedly more crisp and cold than either he or Alesia were accustomed to. The creak of leather sounded from the passenger seat as his childhood friend borrowed deeper into his suit jacket.<br /> <br /> \u201cYou all right?\u201d he asked quietly.<br /> <br /> \u201cI haven\u2019t drunk like that since school.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIs that a good or bad thing?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ll tell you in the morning,\u201d she murmured, \u201cBut I don\u2019t think I\u2019m going to make a habit of it.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m a little surprised you didn\u2019t end up leaving with someone. Honestly, the way you and that blue haired girl were all over each other I was almost expecting you to drag her off into the maze.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m not that kind of gorgon!\u201d But Alesia did blush and squirm a bit as some of the things the other woman had whispered in her ear came to mind. <i>But at least it got your attention.</i><br /> <br /> \u201cFair enough. You did at least get her number I hope.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYeah. Her name\u2019s Kiki and she certainly wanted me to ravish her\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhy didn\u2019t you?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cXANTHIAS!\u201d<br /> <br /> He chuckled. \u201cYou\u2019re the one who always complains that the one of us who can get a date doesn\u2019t want one and the one that wants one can\u2019t find anyone.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYeah\u2026 but not sure we\u2019ve really got anything more than her monster-girl fetish in common. Not exactly much of a foundation there.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s more than Breakfast at Tiffany\u2019s. And maybe not a relationship but certainly a nice hot fling.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThis\u2026 is true I suppose.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd she\u2019s certainly beautiful.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cMaybe I should give YOU her number.\u201d<i> Or invite you to join in...</i><br /> <br /> \u201cSorry. I just want you to be happy Alesia. You are smart and fun and deserve better than you tend to get from people.\u201d<br /> <br /> She started to reach over but couldn\u2019t bring herself to open his coat and let the lingering warmth and scent of him escape into the cold night air. \u201cThanks.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSo. What about that gentleman with the dreadlocks? He seemed\u2026 handsome.\u201d<br /> <br /> Alesia lifted an eyebrow and found her lip quirking slightly. Most couldn\u2019t read anything from Xanthias but she knew him well enough to catch that hint of disapproval. \u201cXavier Chartreuse,\u201d she said quietly, \u201cI\u2019m pretty sure he\u2019s more dangerous than I am.\u201d <i>And that\u2019s what makes him so sexy\u2026</i><br /> <br /> \u201cHe looked human.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI think he is. But I\u2019m pretty sure he\u2019s a dealer. The stuff that isn\u2019t getting legalized.\u201d<br /> <br /> Xan frowned. \u201cMaybe you shouldn\u2019t\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cBut his real passion is music.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI see. You seem to have gotten to know him fairly well.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOnly guy that managed to hold my attention for more than one drink. I let him buy me two.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThree by my count. Just glad he didn\u2019t try to slip you anything.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jealous much? \u201cSapphira and I had each other\u2019s back on that front. I like her. I hope she takes you up on staying. I haven\u2019t had a girl\u2019s night out since\u2026 ever.\u201d<br /> <br /> Xan relaxed and nodded. \u201cI am rather fond of her myself and she\u2019s quite skilled. She would be quite an assent to have as part of the staff. And I could certainly learn a thing or two about earth shaping from her as well.\u201d<br /> <br /> A soft hiss erupted from Alesia\u2019s hair. \u201cThought you had your eye on Lenore.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI hope to help her certainly. But I do not have my eye on either of them like that Alesia.\u201d<br /> <br /> She did her best to impersonate his voice, \u201cWell why not?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cBecause I am not that kind of gorgon either.\u201d<br /> <br /> Their mingled laughter rose as they pulled up to the house they\u2019d so recently taken up residence in together.<br /> -- I described Marneith as \u201cbasically a Mummy 1999 type Mummy.\u201d<br /> <br /> Main things not covered by the journals is Lenore came on Echo\u2019s recommendation. The Oread noted that Lenore had been in a lake that was a popular suicide spot and had an air of melancholy most of the time but was not dangerous. The pond was being drained so she needed a new home.<br /> <br /> Also, while Grozny had a role play in Johnny\u2019s night, he also met three women from the general area of Thailand. The three seemed to be (somewhat desperately) trying to move a large amount of cocaine; seeing Johnny\u2019s pot leaf they guessed he was a drug dealer (and in fact, asked outright if he was a drug dealer. They do not seem good at this). He decided not to smuggle drugs for strange women and had no buyers for hard drugs anyway. On leaving he noticed a pair of Frost Giant thugs moving through the lobby who looked in the room the women were in, but one had cast the illusion of a privacy screen they hid behind. Based on the info he shared with the group, they determined one of them was a Raksashi. The other two he was unsure but they were very cold to the touch\u2026<br /> <br /> Also I had someone make a roll to realize \u201cMilos Grozny\u201d would be \u201cMilos the Terrible.\u201d Also had Brian Thompson as Milos.<br /> <br /> Xanthias used a Health marvel to give Aspasia a frisson when she looked down at him. Smooth.<br /> <br /> -- <div align=\"center\"><u>Session IV</u></div> NOTEBOOK: #769 Lima Echo Echo Uniform Whisky India November<br /> <br /> ENTRY: ALFA FOUR<br /> <br /> Las Vegas, USA<br /> <br /> ASSIGNMENT has been completed. Now we have to run the place.<br /> <br /> We picked up a few recruits:<br /> <br /> &gt;Tristessa, a Lampad, and a well-connected one.<br /> <br /> &gt;Hikaru, a talking umbrella. Why not, I guess?<br /> <br /> We also made contact with a pair of Dwarfs, Hrolof and Krysta, in town. Seemed like jovial sorts, bonded with Avril.<br /> <br /> The Social was a success. All the Patrons seemed pleased. Mother took me aside to talk to me about the conflict between God and Titan, one our Pantheon is very cavalier about. We will need to know about people on all sides to survive, she suggested, even going outside the God-Titan dynamic. She suggested this crossroads she put me on is dangerous, but I was basically dead, or all but. If this time is short, this is a game that eats its players.<br /> <br /> At least there are beautiful women to woo.<br /> <br /> Speaking of which, apparently while we were down there Johnny seduced Demeter. We wanted to give Hades time with Persephone to enjoy each other\u2019s company and Johnny\u2026did that. Better him than me, the whole Dodecatheon is nuts. Anyway.<br /> <br /> I did meet Persephone, who was very pleasant. Mother was fascinating to talk to.<br /> <br /> But I am troubled. Am I even on their side? Whose side is Hecate on? Does it even matter anymore?<br /> <br /> I am going to go lay down<br /> <br /> EINDE<br /> <br /> --<br /> <div align=\"center\"><u><b>Colloquy</b></u></div> <br /> Tristessa walked into the spring from which she heard voices and found the Oreads Echo and Sapphira and the Naiad Lenore reclining in the bubbling spring. Echo, the only one clothed of the group, sat in an ornate Kimono trailing her feet into the pool and trying not to watch the other two women too closely, while Sapphira and Lenore soaked. Tristessa herself disrobed in the dim light and slipped into the bubbling water as well.<br /> <br /> \u201cSo\u2026how are all of you settling in?\u201d the pale woman asked, looking into each of their faces in turn.<br /> <br /> \u201cAll of you settling in.\u201d mumbled Echo. No one acknowledged hearing it.<br /> <br /> \u201cAvril is badass, and Johnny is pretty cool\u2026\u201d Lenore noted.<br /> <br /> \u201cThey aren\u2019t bad.\u201d Sapphira sighed. \u201cNone of the men are grabby, none of the women jealous harridans, about as much as you can really ask for. Better watch Imke, the German though. She\u2019s a shark.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh?\u201d The Lampad raised a manicured eyebrow above her ebon eye.<br /> <br /> \u201cShe seduced that Dark Fae, Aoibhe, pretty much right after she walked in. Has her around her finger. Imke\u2019s fine. I am pretty sure they both see it as a fling. I spoke to Aoibhe today- she was well. Just caught in the whirlwind.\u201d Echo\u2019s soft voice was barely audible over the bubbling of the pool.<br /> <br /> \u201cWell Hecate has decided she is\u2026interesting. I knew she was a Lesbian,\u201d Tristessa said offhandedly. \u201cThe Dark Lady was pleased with her work so far. I can handle her. What about the others?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cXanthias is nice!\u201d Lenore spoke up. \u201cHe kept them from killing Lucky and has been super nice. He did not deny me because of my\u2026history. He has been making sure we are all safe.\u201d Tristessa nodded. \u201cAnything else?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cHe and Alisa have\u2026 a\u2026 thing.\u201d The Tattooed Oread [Sapphira] began. \u201cThey have a lot of working things out to do. I don\u2019t recommend getting involved with either of them. I suspect they will be a situation to watch.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cA situation to watch.\u201d Again, Echo mumbled idly to herself.<br /> <br /> \u201cWho is Alisa\u2019s father, anyway?\u201d the blonde Naiad spoke up. Echo and Tristessa both turned and gave her a look at once. \u201cWait what?\u201d Now Sapphira was paying attention. \u201cWhat\u2019s going on?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDon\u2019t worry about it, little one.\u201d Echo\u2019s voice was unnaturally soothing. Sapphira realized she did not really care who Alisa\u2019s father was anyway. Lenore noticed, and with a glance at the pale Oread decided not to ask anything else.<br /> <br /> \u201cHow about Johnny? How is he?\u201d Tristessa wanted to get things moving.<br /> <br /> \u201cHow is he.\u201d Echo said to herself again.<br /> <br /> \u2018He\u2019s fine. Quietest child of Dionysus as I have ever seen, but of course he still tends to be surrounded by fans. Never given me bad vibes, even ones overcome by good times. Less violent than his dad, I think, but we will see.\u201d Sapphira spoke up this time. \u201cWe get along pretty well. We are more than tits and ass to him, and he has good weed. He hung with Echo and I some.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd Jimmy?\u201d Tristessa looked into their faces.<br /> <br /> The Hesper Evelyn Eventide then entered the room. \u201cOh good, I found where the other Nymphs were hiding. How fucked are we?\u201d She also slipped off her crimson garb, as Echo watched appreciatively. Soon she slipped in the water too, making sure to not get too close to the deathly pale Naiad in the water.<br /> <br /> \u201cThey are fine, they just have to handle the social. I think they will. I will stick around to make sure they do.\u201d Echo spoke up, eyes still following the Hesper.<br /> <br /> \u201cGood we were talking about\u2026Jimmy? Hermes\u2019s son?\u201d Evelyn reclined in the water.<br /> <br /> \u201cYeah I was telling Tristy here none of the guys are assholes and none of the girls are psychos. Jimmy is fine. He hasn\u2019t got his dad\u2019s powers of subtlety yet, wanting to learn as much as he can, but he will be fine. Long as he does not get frustrated and sawed off.\u201d Sapphira\u2019s blue eyes move from Evelyn to Tristessa. \u201cLike I was saying about Johnny. They are finding their feet. I talked to Darius, and he is gonna help bring them up right.\u201d<br /> <br /> Evelyn nodded. \u201cYeah I spoke to Lykos when we met at the Bellagio. Same deal. I think he and Darius are out drinking tonight. They are bringing Hikaru I think. \u201c<br /> <br /> Echo laughs sharply. \u201cI didn\u2019t hear about that.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSo I know I am the young\u2019un here,\u201d Sapphira started, \u201cBut\u2026why are you going by an obvious pseudonym?\u201d She looked at the Hesper.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s a long story. Maybe I will tell you sometime. For now? Imke\u2019s star is on the rise. I think she can protect me from certain parties, and I plan to remain close. In her bed if she keeps doing well.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAre you worried about Aoibhe?\u201d Sapphira kept watching her.<br /> <br /> \u201cWorried about Aoibhe.\u201d Echo mumbled.<br /> <br /> Evelyn shook her head. \u201cI don\u2019t think anyone is expecting that to last. Imke isn\u2019t in love with her.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat happens if Imke does not meet your\u2026expectations?\u201d Sapphira raised an eyebrow.<br /> <br /> Evelyn shook her head again languidly. \u201cShe won\u2019t fail to. Does not bear worrying about.\u201d The Hesper\u2019s voice had a tone of finality.<br /> <br /> \u201cAnyway we also mentioned Xanthias and Alisa.\u201d Sapphira began, and Evelyn chuckled. \u201cThose kids. That\u2019s awesome. I hope it does not explode. Alisa\u2019s mother could cause some chaos.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cPut my money on Johnny for the causing chaos, not Medusa.\u201d Lenore added cheerfully.<br /> <br /> Tristessa spoke up having been listening awhile. \u201cIf Medusa gets out of line she gets cast back into Hades. She will behave. This is her last chance. She knows she can\u2019t mess this up. Xanthias has to get this right.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNo pressure on him or Imke then.\u201d Echo added, dreamily. She disrobed and slipped into the pool herself next to Sapphira. \u201cIt\u2019s a bit unfair. But I will be keeping an eye on things. We need people like them in this next generation of the Pantheon. The Theoi needs some men who aren\u2019t bastards.\u201d She sunk down to her chin.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat about Avril though?\u201d There was a pause, as a smile passed across the women in the pool except the questioner Lenore, who seemed confused. \u201cWhat? Did I miss something?\u201d<br /> <br /> Tristessa laughed. \u201cShe has a look that takes after her patron. A masculine looking woman in a very good way. Apparently, the others noticed that. \u201c<br /> <br /> Sapphira spoke up. \u201cI am just saying I have had a fling with exactly one woman, and it was after I got here, and with Avril and Imke walking around I\u2019d think I was sent here to be corrupted.\u201d Echo silently patted her head in an affectionate, if somewhat dominating, manner.<br /> <br /> \u201cNot my type as much I guess.\u201d Lenore sunk in the water a bit self-consciously.<br /> <br /> \u201cMore for us. \u201cTristessa laughed. \u201cBut seriously, anyone here laying claim? Let\u2019s try to take a page from their book and cooperate rather than compete. I guess Evelyn has her eye on Imke.\u201d<br /> <br /> The Hersper looks to the Lampad. \u201cI am not going to make an exclusive claim on a woman who will likely be among the most beautiful among the Theoi. That\u2019s a path to ruin. Just don\u2019t come between us or try to interfere, and please be careful. She was sharpening her claws on Aoibhe. She has a history of seducing and destroying men and women alike, if not for fun then because she is tasked with it because she does it well. She hopes to no longer have to, but I wager her skill will be too useful not to use, and she will want to avoid making it her legend. Just because she never seems to sleep with men unless she needs to, and if it becomes her legend she will have no choice.\u201d<br /> <br /> Echo spoke up \u201cI am going to recommend not interfering in Xanthias and Alisa. Not unless things get stable between the two of them. I am not getting involved though, so that is up to you.\u201d <br /> <br /> Lenore peered out of the water, only her eyes on the surface though her voice is clear as a bell. \u201cThat sucks he seems nice.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI mean I won\u2019t stop you. I\u2019d just rather you not be added to the statuary.\u201d Sapphira rolled a shrug. \u201cNah don\u2019t have my eye on anyone. Fun flings, maybe.\u201d She looked to Tristessa. \u201cYou?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI am not here looking for a Husband.\u201d She smiled, then glances at Echo, \u201cor a Wife. We will see how it goes. I just got here. I don\u2019t plan on getting in anyone\u2019s way. But we need each other\u2019s back. Do you all think you can do that?\u201d<br /> <br /> One by one, hands came together in the center of the pool. Lenore\u2019s and Echo\u2019s quicky, soon Sapphira\u2019s and Tristessa\u2019s as well. Finally Evelyn slowly added her hand. \u201cSo long as I need not betray my charge.\u201d<br /> <br /> Tristessa shook her head. \u201cHarming Xanthias would send me to my doom at the hands of his Dread mother, much less his father. Avril is a chosen of Artemis and will surely honor her patron and protect us. No, we just need to look out for each other. Not against them. For us.\u201d<br /> <br /> Evelyn gripped the other hands. \u201cFor us.\u201d<br /> <br /> -- <div align=\"center\"><u><b>Scenes from a soir\u00e9e</b></u></div> <br /> Persephone sighed quietly and glanced back at her husband and son as her mother drew her away from the room. Demeter\u2019s pace was a little brisk but at least she\u2019d refrained from saying anything unkind. It pained her that the two loves of life seemed irreconcilable but after centuries it did seem to be the way of it.<br /> <br /> There was a bar set up in the adjoining room and a few of the other guests still present but her gaze was caught by the sight of Dionysus and his son showing off their bar tending tricks together. They did make a handsome sight and she was feeling like a drink.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> As the smile slipped away from Hades\u2019 features the shadows around him thickened but he nodded as he turned his full attention to his son and listened as he explained the progress they\u2019d made and outlined the planned expansions. All quite reasonable and organized, just as he\u2019d expect from the boy. He did note that the pocket square of his suit matched the smart professional dress Alesia was wearing. Interesting. He glanced over to the young gorgon and her mother, speaking quietly across the room.<br /> <br /> Then Xanthias asked about Sullis and Donom staying. He explained how useful they had been and could continue to be, but unspoken was his interest in giving them a longer respite from the underworld. It was a minor enough gift and if the pair had done well no cause not to allow them the break.<br /> <br /> They left the arrival chamber and Hades frowned slightly to see they were entering the same lounge that Demeter and Persephone were in. But then he noticed the amused expression on his wife\u2019s features and took in the way Dionysus\u2019 boy had her mother\u2019s rapt attention. A moment later and the pair left together. He glanced to his son and noticed the pleased smile on his face as he stepped to take his mother\u2019s hand and guide her over to join them.<br /> <br /> \u201cThere,\u201d he said as he nodded to both of them, \u201cNow we can begin the tour.\u201d<br /> <br /> The gods looked at each other and grinned.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> The forest had that primordial air to it that was common in Terra Incognito realms and while such was not normally Medusa\u2019s preference, the inherent sense of isolation and vibrant life was a pleasing change from the dreariness of the underworld. It was a relief to see that her daughter had dressed appropriately for the occasion. The girl wasn\u2019t dumb, far from it, honestly she was too clever for her own good most of the time. And most certainly much too rebellious when the mood struck, which it seemed to without proper warning. The world belonged to humans and humans were vicious and fickle and dangerous and flaunting that you were not one of them could only end one way. And having the favor of a scion was no guarantee since the gods were no better.<br /> <br /> At least the spa seemed poised to succeed. And Xanthias was better than most scions thanks to her hard effort. Better still, the others seemed remarkably sane as well. Of course, so much going so well would only make fate\u2019s sudden but inevitable betrayal that much worse.<br /> <br /> \u201cOver this way are the vineyards,\u201d Alesia was saying as she suddenly stopped, \u201cPet project of Johnny\u2019s as you can guess. But even with his fertility powers it\u2019s not really much to see yet\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> Medusa looked over and spotted the lone figure of Xanthias sitting at one of the covered stone benches scattered about.<br /> <br /> \u201cNothing I haven\u2019t seen before,\u201d she interrupted with a smirk, \u201cBut perhaps you should show me this most fortunate of lindwyrms instead?\u201d<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> The last session was focused on finishing things up. The Dwarfs, Hrolof and his daughter Krysta got the place \u201cwired\u201d for power and internet. One of the Lampades going by the name Tristessa arrived to act as a hostess and majordomo as well. I did not want to add her too early to make sure the PCs were making all the important decisions. The talking umbrella was a Karakasa-Koz\u014d called in by Echo; her wife Erika Lacey is a Kami and has connection to many Y\u014dkai. Echo also ended up chasing a Shirime with a broom until Avril menaced it with a rifle. Maybe don\u2019t Google Shirime at work.<br /> <br /> The PCs had little opposition in this story, beyond a few enemies to bulldoze at the start. This was because I wanted them to spend most of it getting a feel for their characters and a feel for how the Spa would work. I wanted it to reflect the PCs after all. Also, a low threat way to get used to the system, as only two players had played Scion before and no one me included had ever played Storypath.<br /> <br /> Adding pictures to this thing is complicated, but if folks want any NPC pics I will manage.<br /> <br /> So we are one session into the second Arc, but I will put a few posts up with more info and, of course, would be happy for questions or comments. I will probably also post the Influencers sheet just so it is here too. Thanks for reading, hope it is inspirational or at least entertaining.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-09T18:42:24-08:00","id":1476134,"title":"","content":"In about a fortnight I am going to be posting the next few journals. I wanted to repost this to have it in this thread before I post those. Enjoy.<br /> <br /> Lords and Ladies,<br /> <br /> I have made a few discreet enquires and have put together a list of some good Influencers you may want to bring in. I can make the arrangements. I\u2019ve done research and thrown in some personal anecdotes as well but been as objective as possible. I have also asked around for more views. You may want to do two groups if you use several. I hope it is helpful. Let me know if you have questions<br /> <br /> Tristessa<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>Annika</u></b><br /> <br /> Background: J\u00f6tun, Frost Giant; \u00c6sir. From northwestern Sweden. She/They<br /> <br /> Annika is a Frost Giant, or J\u00f6tun, and cousin to a number of \u00c6sir. In her natural state she is about five and a half meters tall (around eighteen feet in old money) but usually among mortals she shrinks to a \u201conly\u201d about two meters (about seven feet in old money). Annika is known for her \u201cTop of the Mountain\u201d Blog where she climbs mountains, goes rappelling, goes BASE jumping and generally does things that would be suicidal for most people, including impressive feats of strength. Her work hard/play hard style appeals to a lot of \u00c6sir, but she is going to be on the wrong side during Ragnar\u00f6k apparently, so she is not exactly trusted. However, as she gets along with both sides her presence at the spa would be noticed by both, plus she appeals to the muscle girl crowd.<br /> <br /> Risk Assessment: High. She is a giant. J\u00f6tun are living metaphors for destruction. But she can play nice. However, if things go wrong, they go very, very wrong.<br /> <br /> Personal Information: I don\u2019t know much about Annika\u2019s romantic inclinations. She likes men, and if she is not Bi or Pan the world will be drowned by Sapphic tears. She parties hard drinking heavily but not usually drugs so much. Annika is an Omnivore.<br /> <br /> Darius: Hell. Yes.<br /> <br /> Evelyn: Remember J\u00f6tun n are cunning bastards. Don\u2019t underestimate her because she is a giant. She is likely a talented illusionist as well as having frost abilities. I don\u2019t know enough about her personally to add much to that.<br /> <br /> Hrolof: She is okay for a Giant, I guess.<br /> <br /> Krysta: I want to be her when I grow up. Yes, I know I am 75.<br /> <br /> Sapphira: You are doing this on purpose, aren\u2019t you?<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>Chloe</u></b><br /> <br /> Background: Oread, Nymph; Theoi. From Corinth, Greece. She/Her<br /> <br /> Chloe is a young-ish Oread who has become a Goth icon with her Blog \u201cDark Side of the Mountain.\u201d Her Goth following is huge, her clothes are worn all over and a tombstone sculpted her goes for a fortune, even among non-Hellenismos. Like most Oreads, Chloe is an even-tempered sort, though given to at least a show of drama. She makes Goth trends more than most Underworld Gods these days; get her visiting and all the spooky kids will show.<br /> <br /> Risk Assessment: Low, Oreads tend to be stable, and tougher than most Nymphs. Worst thing is she will want to see the graveyards and haunted spots. So far as I know, Chloe has no special ability to see or interact with the Dead.<br /> <br /> Personal Information: Like most Nymphs, Chloe is Bisexual. She has had flings with several genders but tends to be fairly discreet. Her hardest drugs are Absinthe so far as I can tell, maybe E during sex. Chloe is an omnivore.<br /> <br /> Darius: I have interacted with Chloe several times. She is a good kid. Power has not gone to her head yet. Can be a bit of a tease.<br /> <br /> Echo: I don\u2019t know Chloe, really, but I follow her and she is quite the fashionista. I know Tristessa does too because I have seen her rocking some of Chloe\u2019s looks. Get her in.<br /> <br /> Evelyn: Chloe has Nymphagram followers in several Pantheons. She is a good pick.<br /> <br /> Lykos: Yeah you should pick her. Because Reasons.<br /> <br /> Sapphira: Chloe is not as legendary as Echo but well respected among Oreads.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>Doris</u></b><br /> <br /> Background: Nereid, Nymph; Theoi. From Samos, Greece. She/Her<br /> <br /> Doris got big for her Nymphagram \u201cMediterranean Blue.\u201d She did a lot of pics on and of cruise ships (Cruise ships often let Nereids ride free as the sea treats them kindly) along with sites across the Mediterranean and she actually has a head on her shoulders. However, last year she and her girlfriend, a Siren named Monica, had a messy and somewhat public break-up, and she has been Nymphagramming from the Caribbean instead since (ironic, if you like Enya. You probably haven\u2019t heard of her.) But she is expanding from just sea stuff with mixed success. This could be good for her career and show she is not a one trick pony.<br /> <br /> Risk Assessment: Low. Nereids are the easiest to deal with of water Nymphs. However, she is still stinging from a break-up and may throw herself into something unwise.<br /> <br /> Personal Information: Like most Nymphs, Doris is Bisexual. She drinks a lot but in general water Nymphs tend to handle their liquor well. Doris is a Pescatarian.<br /> <br /> Darius: Doris is fine. That thing I said about how Chloe has not let her power get to her head? That\u2019s less true of Doris. She is a diva, but not too much of a malaka.<br /> <br /> Echo: Point of order, Doris the mother of the original Nereids is not Doris the Nereid, this Doris is named for her grandmother. I don\u2019t know Doris the Nereid at all but she might clash with Lenore.<br /> <br /> Evelyn: There are rumors Doris got a taste for Human flesh while with her Siren girlfriend, but this has been done without any real evidence, and my view it was probably just because she had a Siren girlfriend. As Echo said, this Doris is not that Doris.<br /> <br /> Lenore: Second point of order, Naiads are not Nereids. To Nereids we are backwater bumpkins at best and all cannibals at worst. To overly simplify Nereids= saltwater, Naiads=freshwater. I don\u2019t tend to get along with Nereids, everyone loves them and they are full of themselves. I have no specific issue with Doris and am okay with her coming. Just don\u2019t expect me to hang out with her. The feeling will probably be mutual.<br /> <br /> Lykos: Far be it from me to recommend you set up Lenore and Doris to get in a fistfight but I bet it would be awesome, and it would probably go viral.<br /> <br /> Sapphira: From what I know she knows how to party in a generally good way.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>Hinako Hinagawa</u></b><br /> <br /> Background: Rokoro-Kubi, Y\u014dkai; Kami. From Tokyo. She/Her<br /> <br /> Hinako\u2019s career took off from her photobombing pictures with her long neck, and she quickly became an endearing part of the blogging scene. These days having her head peek in the window for a picture or vlog will immediately get you views. She likes getting shots of her peeping in windows and such, and sometimes posts pictures where her head is sort of hidden peeking out from behind a chair or window labeled \u201cI am not in this picture.\u201d Also eating desserts, especially with just her head and long neck. She has recurring tiktoks of her using her long neck to steal cupcakes with her mouth. Even I think it is adorable.<br /> <br /> Risk Assessment: Hard to say. Not much info about her personally. She is not known for causing too much issue, but she often can\u2019t resist peeking into high windows or over newspapers, which may cause info. Most Rokoro-Kubi have an urge to occasionally startle or scare that is hard to suppress.<br /> <br /> Background: Hinako came out as Bisexual on Nymphagram. Her whole dating history so far is human men, and reasonably discreet (her Nymphagram updates are not about her love life). I don\u2019t know of her having any issues with alcohol or drugs, just sweets. She leans Pescatarian but is not a strict one. For example, pretty much any dessert is apparently okay.<br /> <br /> Echo: I don\u2019t know Hinako, but she seems to be a cinnamon roll.<br /> <br /> Hikaru: From what I know, Hinako is respected in Y\u014dkai circles, and she has absolutely made Rokoro-Kubi more well-loved. While I can\u2019t say much about her personally, I am not worried the sweet demeanor is an act.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>Katar\u00edna Kova\u010di\u0107</u></b><br /> <br /> Background: Rusalka; Bogovi. From somewhere in western Silesia. She/Her<br /> <br /> Katarina Kova\u010di\u0107 (Ko-WAH-chik) is well known as one of the biggest Eastern European Nymphagrammers, known from the far ends of Russia to Czech Republic. Women love her style and sexual adventures, men love her. She has been attached to a lot of Nymphagrammers, models, and celebrities, and loves taking pictures of herself in their bedrooms and on their boats. She is apparently an absolute maneater, possibly literally; Accusations of her devouring some of her less well-known lovers follow her, and she even had one well meaning Scion go after her. If she is eating people she is good at covering her tracks. Let me say this: She has the biggest following of all these people, any two put together probably do not equate her following. You want the word out, get Katarina.<br /> <br /> Risk Assessment: High. Katarina may eat people, she is hard to control, she drinks heavily and likes recreational drugs. If she has a hookup with you (or any locals) the internet WILL know, with one major caveat. The only saving grace is she is apparently pretty dangerous so if she walks down a dark alley, she probably won\u2019t need rescuing.<br /> <br /> Background: Let me put this delicately; Katarina has implied she is Straight without saying it and has only been pictured with or officially connected to men. It\u2019s an open secret though to anyone who has partied with her in Ibiza or other places that when cameras are not on her beauty and proximity mean far, far more than gender. Beyond that, Katarina has an appetite for everything and possibly everyone.<br /> <br /> Darius: I think Tristessa is being a little harsh and sex shamy here. I have met Katarina a few times and we got along fine. She wasn\u2019t a malaka, didn\u2019t hurt anyone, and didn\u2019t vomit on anything. She was eating E like candy. Now, at one point we did have sex on the roof, full disclosure. But she did not ruin my rep or try to kill me. She even wingma\u2019amed for me once. I mean absolutely keep an eye on her. But a lot of this are innuendos. She does flirt with girls even if she does not advertise it.<br /> <br /> Echo: Well\u2026if you show her a good time, she will be a very good thing for your spa. I don\u2019t know her, and I don\u2019t like her. If you think you can handle her go for it.<br /> <br /> Evangeline: She sounds awesome.<br /> <br /> Lenore: Word down the stream is she has devoured men and women, yeah. But word down the stream is I drown people for fun. Does not make it true.<br /> <br /> Lykos: I hear she is pretty wild, but while I met her once no issue. Biggest problem is men fighting over her. She really likes men fighting over her.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>Keiko</u></b><br /> <br /> Background: Noppera-b\u014d, Y\u014dkai; Kami. From Shikoku (now Ehime prefecture) in Japan. She/Her but any are fine.<br /> <br /> Keiko is a recent case on Nymphagram. She is not as big as the others, but her \u201cFace Time\u201d account is growing, and Echo recommends her. She shows how to make a lot of traditional Japanese clothes and items. She also occasionally posts videos of her scaring people from remote camera or drone.<br /> <br /> Risk Assessment: Low. Well, seems low. No sign Keiko is a problem. I don\u2019t have a great deal of info to work with.<br /> <br /> Background: Keiko is Straight, well as Straight as any woman is around Imke. She drinks lightly but should not be an issue. Keiko is an omnivore.<br /> <br /> Echo: Keiko goes back to the Tokugawa Shogunate. She has worked with my wife before, and I would consider it a personal favor if you raised her profile. Noppera-b\u014d can be useful friends to have, and Keiko is a long-term planner, one a few centuries old. You want her on your side, especially if you have a tangle with the Kami.<br /> <br /> Hikaru: I didn\u2019t know she was on Nymphagram, but Keiko is a pro at whatever she sets her mind to.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>Tr\u00edona McInnes</u></b><br /> <br /> Background: Banshee, Unseelie Aos Sidhe; Tuatha D\u00e9 Dannan. From Scotland in the UK. She/Her<br /> <br /> Tr\u00edona\u2019s (TREE-nah) Nymphagram, \u201cThe Bashful Banshee\u201d is a soft Sapphic Nymphagram with a huge following of Queer women. Her neo-Victorian style also gets her attention from Steampunk types and Neo-Victorian imitators. She manifests as a soft spoken, somewhat Gothy pale woman. She is never in Banshee form in her pictures. She is apparently a real sweetheart.<br /> <br /> Risk Assessment: Medium. Tr\u00edona\u2019s biggest risk is a Banshee problem. If she senses danger or potential death, she has the urge to shift back to her Banshee form, glide over to the source, and scream. For this reason, she tends to avoid big cities. In the spa she can even be useful, but outside keep an eye on her for if she is spacing. She will try to resist the Call and honestly, she may be able to, but once she is in scream mode she will be hard to manage. Keep her away from hospitals.<br /> <br /> Background: Tr\u00edona is a Femme Lesbian. She is not given to wild romances, hard drugs or heavy drinking, though she gets giggly on wine. Tr\u00edona is an omnivore.<br /> <br /> Aoibhe: Note Tr\u00edona is not a noble of the Dark Fey, so her bearing will be somewhat different than mine, and she cannot wield mortals\u2019 own nightmares against them like I can. I don\u2019t really know Tr\u00edona, but what I know of her is good and I am sure she will be a benefit for you. Remember the Unseelie Court don\u2019t hold particular affiliation to either the Tuatha D\u00e9 Dannan nor Tuatha D\u00e9 Domnann on a Courtwide basis. I am unsure if Tr\u00edona has a particular affiliation.<br /> <br /> Darius: I\u2019ve met her, she is darling.<br /> <br /> Echo: Tr\u00edona is an absolute sweetheart. Don\u2019t let anything happen to her or I will be cross.<br /> <br /> --<br /> A few final notes. These are as always just suggestions if I were doing it.<br /> <br /> Avril, you will do best as a bodyguard, but you may get along with Chloe and Doris being Nymphs. Artemis is seen as a safe person by us. You might also get along with the more physical Annika.<br /> <br /> Imke, you channel the purview of Beauty, and you are going to get attention. A lot good, many will like you and several may have clothes \u201caccidentally\u201d fall off, but some may be jealous and some may be jealous of others giving you attention and get in fights over you. If this happens you need to be the one to break them up even if you are enjoying the attention secretly.<br /> <br /> Johnny, I honestly figure everyone is going to like you. Dionysus son, swell guy, you are the one who will make this work. But I think if you follow your instincts this will go well. I will be at your side to advise in an instant if you need it. You have got this; you are going to make this succeed. But don\u2019t get complacent, keep an open ear. And remember it might be worth upsetting someone if they ask for something that will harm the place\u2019s rep. But get Xanthias to say no for you. No need to be bad cop.<br /> <br /> Jimmy, like Avril you will be on bodyguard duty. You will probably be chauffer too. Keep an ear to the underworld (little u) and remember we do have a serial slasher out there.<br /> <br /> Xanthias, it\u2019s up to you how much you want to be up front. I recommend Johnny take point, but you and Imke have roles to play as well. I recommend you play bad cop if it has to happen. I expect you will do it well. I think some of the girls probably will like a man in charge, if that is your thing, and I am sure you can play guide as well as Imke.<br /> <br /> Now, if you do two groups or only bring in five or less you can assign each one a handler. It is up to you if you wish to do that or have Johnny coral all of them as a rule. Either can work, I would ask Johnny what he thinks he is ready for. If you do two groups of 3 or a 3 and 4, either could work.<br /> <br /> If it were me, and to be clear it is not, I would put Chloe and Doris together in one group and Hinako and Keiko in the other. That way each one has a countrymen with them. I would separate Annika and Katarina as those two have the most red flags, if you bring them in at all. Tr\u00edona could go with either group, I would put her with Chloe those two might bond. But please, you all decide.<br /> <br /> Echo says remember Y\u014dkai tend to find each other and the more of them there are the more chaotic and unpredictable they get, even usually well-behaved ones. The only downside of Hinako and Keiko being at the spa at the same time is suddenly three Y\u014dkai together. Do not let Hikaru go out on the town with them just to keep mischievous instincts in check. Vegas is not Y\u014dkai central, but this is a factor that can affect things. We do not want a Hyakki Yakou on the strip like the climax of an 80s movie.<br /> <br /> Well, I don\u2019t. Maybe you do.<br /> While the spa should be the focus, look around for good local spots to take them. Aspasia\u2019s Labyrinth seems like a good option, though I have not actually been there yet it has a reputation as an influencer place to be so you may take them a time or two. But Vegas has other options. For example, Chloe might want to see the La Palazza Mansion or Hotel Apache, Doris might want to see Hoover Dam and all that water, Katarina will probably want to see a couple rich expensive casinos.<br /> <br /> Finally, all these people, with the exception of Keiko who I have no real information on, have had satisfactory trips that all parties came out feeling positive. Anyone who was an annoying brat not worth the trouble did not make it to your desk. Some are riskier, yes, but everyone (again, except Keiko) has the backing of previous hosts/employers who hired them for events like this.<br /> <br /> Lords and Ladies I remain,<br /> <br /> Your humble Tristessa<br /> <br /> Week #1<br /> <br /> Chloe is arriving at 2:00 Friday at the Pyramid of the Luxor (5 min on foot to station house, 20 min drive to the Spa) from the Pyramids in Argolis, Greece. She is staying till early Monday. She wants to spend one night at the Luxor, but otherwise is open (She is willing to stay an extra night to accommodate your schedule).<br /> <br /> Tr\u00edona and Doris are both arriving at 4:00 on Friday.<br /> <br /> Tr\u00edona is arriving from the Pyramids at Balmoral. Staying till early Monday. No other requests.<br /> <br /> Doris is arriving at the Statue of Liberty at the New York, New York Hotel (20 min on foot to station house, 15 minutes to the Luxor, 20 min drive to the Spa) from the Statue of Liberty at Mytilene in Lesbos, Greece,. Staying till early Monday. No other requests.<br /> <br /> The Piranha Club is around a 15 min drive to the spa, 6 minute drive to the station house, or 42 min walk from the station house.<br /> <br /> The Temptation Sunday Pool party is at the Luxor, 5 min walk from the Station House.<br /> <br /> Week #2<br /> <br /> Annika will be arriving at the Luxor from the Pyramid of Stj\u00e4rneborg in Sweden at noon. She wants to BASE Jump from the Strat, and possibly do \u201csomething awesome at that dam\u201d<br /> <br /> Week #3<br /> <br /> Hinako and Keiko will be arriving at the Paris from the Tokyo Tower at 7:00 pm Thursday, assuming Friday is day one. They want to take a day to get their internal clocks set, and can stay at the hotel if we cannot accommodate them (I am sure we can). Hinako wants to \u201chave fun (smiley peace sign)\u201d<br /> <br /> Week #4<br /> <br /> Katarina will be arriving at the New York, New York hotel from the Victory Hotel in Pristina, Kosovo at 2:00 pm. She wishes to \u201cplay it by ear\u201d<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/